The patches in `tools/patches/` (`DiffSinger.patch`, `seed-vc.patch`) modify third-party code and are under the upstream project's license, not Edittude's MIT grant. `DiffSinger.patch` stays under DiffSinger's MIT license, Copyright (c) 2021 Jinglin Liu. `seed-vc.patch` stays under GPL-3.0. The root `LICENSE` does not relicense either patch.

