`install.sh` fetches uv from <https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh> when it is missing. The script does not pin a commit. On `main` the README says uv is licensed under either Apache-2.0 (`LICENSE-APACHE`) or MIT (`LICENSE-MIT`). Both files were read: <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/astral-sh/uv/main/LICENSE-APACHE>, <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/astral-sh/uv/main/LICENSE-MIT>, <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/astral-sh/uv/main/README.md>. The GitHub repository license API reports SPDX `Apache-2.0` only.

